# Fn+Backspace (XF86TaskPane, see Xsession.post/26n950-keyboard): the
# application goes to the background and hildon-desktop shows the task
# switcher, as on Harmattan; also out of a full-screen window.
# Bound by keycode with Mod5 (ISO_Level3_Shift = Fn): given the keysym,
# xbindkeys grabs the key's keycode without a modifier, i.e. plain Backspace.
"dbus-send --session --type=signal /com/nokia/hildon_desktop com.nokia.hildon_desktop.exit_app_view"
    m:0x80 + c:22
